335 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/ActualText(To achieve this, we will leverage key touchpoints in the customer journey, including social platforms like TikTok and Instagram, by producing engaging content, collaborating with influencers, and driving visibility. For sales, we\220ll target our Shopify store as the primary channel to reach our target audience.)/Pg 21 0 R/K[8]/Alt()>>
